<title>UK: Freistaat Bayern adds 750 mln marks to 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>Freistaat Bayern adds 750 mln marks to 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Landesbank, ABN AMRO, Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FREISTAAT BAYERN</p>
<p> AMT   *1.750 BLN DEM COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    30 OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE**99.60     PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGIHNALLY LAUNCHED FOR 1.0 BLN DEM ON 15.OCT.96</p>
<p>		**ORIGINAL ISSUE PRICE 99.0 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    MUNICH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	LANDESSCHATZANWEISUNG JUMBO ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
